>Uhm...  what word?  
>What can you write that does any good?  What is a magic marker for ( writing
>I assume, but see the 1st question! )

Elbereth is the word.

Normally after you write it you can't attack monsters since doing so ruins the
writing.  If you are levitating this can't happen.  Also, writing with a magic
marker, athame, wand of fire, wand of digging, wand of lightning, or sharp
weapon causes a semi-permanent writing which will only have a low chance of
getting ruined.  (Sharp weapons are useless for this purpose--although they
work, they take too long to use, and using them ruins the weapon.  Athames
are best, since they have unlimited uses.  The other items use charges when
you engrave with them.)
